# This project resolves every dependency from the public npm registry.
#
# Dependabot's `automatic-github-packages-auth` experiment injects an
# npm.pkg.github.com credential for the org even though nothing here is
# published to GitHub Packages. Without an explicit registry declaration
# Dependabot aborts file-fetching with `private_registry_config_not_found`,
# which blocks every npm dependency PR. Pinning the public registry here
# satisfies that requirement and keeps local/CI installs deterministic.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
